            This sample shows how to create a new PDF document using ExpertPdf, how to add a new page to the document and write a simple text on it.
        </p>
        <p>
            <input type="submit" name="BtnConvert" value="Create PDF" class="mybutton" />
        </p>
    </div>
    <!-- .entry-content -->
</article>
